Z||000004||DRH||09-13-2001||10:44 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jake_Dragon:<BR><B>Same jerks that charge you $5.00 for gas.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>No... probably MUCH worse. There is a good  possibility many of the station owners were just giving in to the same panic that made the people line up for blocks when they didn't really need gas. At least around here the lines came BEFORE the price increases.<P>These scams are not panic driven. They are cold calculated efforts to profit from someone's generosity. The bottom feeders are coming out...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
